  "label": "Islamophobia Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Muslims are inherently violent or prone to aggression, particularly when offended. This stereotype is a core component of Islamophobia and is used to delegitimize Muslim emotional responses and to scapegoat the group for acts of violence, even when those acts are not connected to the specific offense mentioned (jokes).",
